WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.200
In the New Kingdom, Egypt became an empire, and the pharaoh stood at its center — ruler, general, and high priest in one.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:20.485
Campaigns pushed borders far to the south and east, while at home, temples rose in stone and festivals filled the streets.

00:00:20.485 --> 00:00:29.000
Every statue and every relief repeated one message: the king upholds maat, and the kingdom endures.

